Completed tasks and  achieved milestones 

So far 5 independent ETL pipeline has been successfully deployed in the AWS cloud environment, leveraging managed services for scalability and reliability. Key milestones include: 

Infrastructure Setup: 

Provisioned infrastructure using Terraform for automated, consistent deployments.  

Integrated Jenkins for CI/CD workflows and GitHub for source code management, enabling version control, collaboration, and automated testing. 

Pipeline Development: 

Raw Data Ingestion: Implemented Glue jobs to ingest external data into Amazon S3 in Parquet format for efficient storage and processing. 

Data Processing and Classification: Developed Glue jobs to clean, enrich, and classify records into clean, quarantined, and warning categories based on data quality and business rules. 

Data Loading: Designed a robust loading strategy for the target RDS database, ensuring referential integrity through staged tables, orphan record handling, and deferred constraint checks. 

Derived Data Generation: Created Glue jobs to normalize and generate derived datasets from clean data, meeting specific business requirements. 

Data Storage and Archival: 

Utilized Amazon S3 buckets for raw and processed data storage. 

Enabled long-term data archival of raw and processed data in Amazon Glacier for historical retention leveraging S3 lifecycle rules.  

Testing and Code Optimization: 

Developed unit tests with at least 80% coverage to ensure reliability and correctness of pipeline components. 

Conducted revisions and continuous code enhancements to improve performance, reliability, and processing time, 

Security and Credential Management: 

Integrated AWS Secrets Manager to securely store credentials for external APIs, S3 buckets, and the target RDS database. 

Implemented security scanning as part of the CI/CD process to identify and mitigate vulnerabilities. 

 

Workflow Optimization: 

Established a reliable pipeline workflow with error handling, rollback mechanisms, and materialized view refresh processes to ensure data integrity and seamless operations 

Configured job status notifications using Amazon EventBridge and SNS to alert team members 

